    "content": "CallMeMaybe is designed to teach students how to perform function calling with Small Language Models (LLMs) using Python.\nThe goal is to create an algorithm that uses the provided `Small_LLM_Model` class, a wrapper around the `Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B` Small Language Model, to generate structured Function Calling dictionaries from natural language prompts.\n",
